        {
          "commit": "46579c049a305b6a146d1028e539ca6d071fbfb4",
          "git_sha": "d60bf298b4413bca11d019349476548c97a44d42",
          "line_end": 83,
          "line_start": 78,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "jmfederico/pi-web",
          "url": "https://github.com/jmfederico/pi-web/blob/46579c049a305b6a146d1028e539ca6d071fbfb4/README.md#L78-L83"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_51ada53fcbc4f60df93f903de568f0292afe70c6cff9374f4e04d27a140955c7"
      ],
      "text": "The product organizes work hierarchically: a machine is a runtime endpoint, a project is a folder on it, a workspace is a provider-owned working folder, and a session is a Pi Coding Agent chat inside a workspace."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_d60f58ee64c1335c77a3db2cdbda825769fcaafa33eba90b80c6f1faa15a259c",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "46579c049a305b6a146d1028e539ca6d071fbfb4",
          "git_sha": "d60bf298b4413bca11d019349476548c97a44d42",
          "line_end": 29,
          "line_start": 24,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "jmfederico/pi-web",
          "url": "https://github.com/jmfederico/pi-web/blob/46579c049a305b6a146d1028e539ca6d071fbfb4/README.md#L24-L29"
        },
        {
          "commit": "46579c049a305b6a146d1028e539ca6d071fbfb4",
          "git_sha": "d60bf298b4413bca11d019349476548c97a44d42",
          "line_end": 31,
          "line_start": 31,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "jmfederico/pi-web",
          "url": "https://github.com/jmfederico/pi-web/blob/46579c049a305b6a146d1028e539ca6d071fbfb4/README.md#L31-L31"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_609f25774f42885b122dd93999df4490c7aabfbec164fd0116b05fa08d18f6a6",
        "slc_a888cfaf4545a5e50f1c03b4fee5a1c6371eca3920e6f449c994a6d787e77ca9"
      ],
      "text": "Sessions are designed to survive browser disconnects, letting users supervise agents from any browser while work continues on the host machine."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_8967c45b5d29a110cdac6308247608e5f58ccb0c57c0ee54df69052f026a0011",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "46579c049a305b6a146d1028e539ca6d071fbfb4",
          "git_sha": "d60bf298b4413bca11d019349476548c97a44d42",
          "line_end": 40,
          "line_start": 37,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "jmfederico/pi-web",
          "url": "https://github.com/jmfederico/pi-web/blob/46579c049a305b6a146d1028e539ca6d071fbfb4/README.md#L37-L40"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_1a3bd483bc6078988a166993eb8ae11c9d71ad2c8832f8e54fc462aacda107e5"
      ],
      "text": "Running PI WEB requires Node.js 22.19.0 or newer, npm, a Pi Coding Agent of at least version 0.84.0, and git plus the development tools agents need."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_a4d9cf321f8ecae1861ede17de1fd1a7e7553eb219d6e9ed4c289cf1f66d1714",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
