          "git_sha": "422a0b0ad4e1d758483c3ba6b503c526559f6d4a",
          "line_end": 198,
          "line_start": 198,
          "path": "docs/config.md",
          "repository": "jmfederico/pi-web",
          "url": "https://github.com/jmfederico/pi-web/blob/46579c049a305b6a146d1028e539ca6d071fbfb4/docs/config.md#L198-L198"
        },
        {
          "commit": "46579c049a305b6a146d1028e539ca6d071fbfb4",
          "git_sha": "422a0b0ad4e1d758483c3ba6b503c526559f6d4a",
          "line_end": 200,
          "line_start": 200,
          "path": "docs/config.md",
          "repository": "jmfederico/pi-web",
          "url": "https://github.com/jmfederico/pi-web/blob/46579c049a305b6a146d1028e539ca6d071fbfb4/docs/config.md#L200-L200"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_0b9de41441998b515d7ccb616f8864106a7ae5e2072a7e7fba0d6bdf2cd9d5cd",
        "slc_80bca31cd895d5d5892a8f41efd5682acfe52288d68bf897b225d87eaae3a42b"
      ],
      "text": "PI_WEB_DATA_DIR sets the root for managed runtime state (default ~/.pi-web), holding project and machine registries, discovered plugins, the session-daemon socket, and session archives; each data directory starts independent and empty."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_e50a8246cedf5912f0eae6378494203698501ec6ef69568902a56b87cd1b1640",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "46579c049a305b6a146d1028e539ca6d071fbfb4",
          "git_sha": "422a0b0ad4e1d758483c3ba6b503c526559f6d4a",
          "line_end": 202,
          "line_start": 202,
          "path": "docs/config.md",
          "repository": "jmfederico/pi-web",
          "url": "https://github.com/jmfederico/pi-web/blob/46579c049a305b6a146d1028e539ca6d071fbfb4/docs/config.md#L202-L202"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a20fa5fd5cb96e76bcb4ea4bf723b3c136cb090710abd4db9266a71afad97c3d"
      ],
      "text": "One live session daemon owns each data directory, recording ownership in sessiond-owner.json; a second daemon pointed at the same directory fails loudly at startup, while stale markers from dead daemons are taken over automatically."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
