        "slc_65fd6b31158447b65bf0d61c925192c5d4f2b514b806adfbbee89ff2a7ed5dfa"
      ],
      "text": "Configuration resolves as defaults, then the global config file, then environment overrides; project-local <project>/.pi-web/config.json can override upload and attachment defaults and merge allowed paths."
    },
